1
00:00:00,302 --> 00:00:01,872
(Penny:)Excuse me.

2
00:00:07,075 --> 00:00:09,815
(Sheldon:)I've been studying how
to make people laugh.

3
00:00:12,814 --> 00:00:17,734
(Sheldon:)They say that comedy
is tragedy plus time.

4
00:00:18,954 --> 00:00:21,494
(Sheldon:)-Let's tickle some ribs.
-No!

5
00:00:25,294 --> 00:00:27,834
(Penny(on phone):)No, Dad, I don't think they
cut me out of the show

6
00:00:27,996 --> 00:00:30,236
(Penny(on phone):)because I was too pretty.

7
00:00:31,934 --> 00:00:35,904
(Penny(on phone):)No, I don't need you to come out
and kick Mark Harmon's ass.

8
00:00:38,006 --> 00:00:40,816
(Penny(on phone):)Daddy, I gotta go.
I love you. Bye.

9
00:00:42,110 --> 00:00:45,090
(Leonard:)-How you doing?
-(GROANS) This is such a disaster.

10
00:00:45,247 --> 00:00:47,527
(Penny:)My parents had all my relatives over.

11
00:00:47,683 --> 00:00:50,293
(Penny:)They got one of those
six-foot sandwiches,

12
00:00:50,452 --> 00:00:53,522
(Penny:)and got my brother
a day pass out of rehab and...

13
00:00:54,990 --> 00:00:58,490
(Penny:)...now he's missing
and the sandwich is missing, and...

14
00:00:58,660 --> 00:01:03,020
(Penny:)They're probably in Mexico by now.
So humiliating.

